### Manual requests for the Claims API (IntelliJ HTTP Client: click the green arrow beside a request).
### Start ClaimsApiApplication first. dateOfLoss must be within the last 365 days and not in the future.

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Submit a valid claim -> 201 with a claim number
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/claims
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: manual-test-1

{
  "customer": {
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "O'Neil",
    "email": "jane.oneil@example.com",
    "phone": "2045550142"
  },
  "policyNumber": "HO-12345678",
  "dateOfLoss": "2026-10-15",
  "lossType": "WATER",
  "propertyAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main Street",
    "city": "Winnipeg",
    "province": "MB",
    "postalCode": "R3C 1A1"
  },
  "description": "Pipe burst in the basement overnight and flooded the laundry room.",
  "consentAcknowledged": true
}

### Several invalid fields -> 400 problem+json, one error per field
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {
    "firstName": "",
    "lastName": "O'Neil",
    "email": "not-an-email"
  },
  "policyNumber": "HO-1",
  "dateOfLoss": "2030-01-01",
  "lossType": "FIRE",
  "propertyAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main Street",
    "city": "Winnipeg",
    "province": "MB",
    "postalCode": "12345"
  },
  "description": "Too short",
  "consentAcknowledged": false
}

### Unknown field -> 400 UNKNOWN_FIELD
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isAdmin": true }

### Wrong content type -> 415
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/claims
Content-Type: text/plain

hello
